text: |-
  The company told TMZ it dug into
  Robinson's activity after his arrest.
  Investigators did find an account linked to
  him. But Discord insists it found no evidence
  that Robinson plotted violence or shared
  anything related to the killing on its servers.
  "Messages referenced in recent reporting
  about planning details do not appear to be
  Discord messages," a company
  spokesperson told TMZ. Instead, those
  words came from a note Robinson left
  behind and conversations his roommate
  later relayed to a friend.
